    <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p>The Odoo Phone 19 delivers everything your team needs to stay connected, with no unnecessary distractions. Built for straightforward business integration, it syncs natively with your Odoo Fleet and Employees apps. Maintain total oversight with instant access provisioning, reliable asset tracking, and remote wipe capabilities straight from your central dashboard.</p><p><strong> Keep it simple. Secure your workflow today.</strong></p>]]></field>
