able_of_content_link_depth_1">LiDAR Depth Scanner</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_16" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Technical Specifications</a></div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-9 s_table_of_content_main oe_structure oe_empty o_colored_level" data-name="Content">
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_1" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Business &amp; Brilliance, Beautifully Combined</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead">Crafted in our signature Deep Plum Purple, Midnight Black or Forest Green, the Odoo Phone 20 isn't just a smartphone; it's your mobile command center. Whether you are scanning inventory in the warehouse, closing deals on the road, or capturing stunning marketing assets, the Odoo Phone 20 delivers fluid performance powered by native Odoo ecosystem integration.  </p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_2" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Key Innovations</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_7"><span class="h5-fs">Native Odoo Integration</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                Comes pre-loaded with Odoo Mobile OS, offering zero-latency synchronization with your company's database, Point of Sale, and CRM. 
                            </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_6">Built-in Barcode Engine</h3><p class="lead">
                                Hardware-accelerated 1D/2D barcode scanning directly through the camera for lightning-fast inventory management and stock moves. </p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_8"><span class="h5-fs">All-Day Enterprise Battery</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                A massive 5500mAh dual-cell battery optimized specifically for continuous, screen-on enterprise application usage. </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_9">Military-Grade Security</h3><p class="lead">Deep-silicon encryption protocols ensure your company's proprietary data and customer information remain strictly confidential. </p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_10" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">The Master Camera System</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_11" class="lead">Equipped with our revolutionary <b>7-lens rear array</b>, the Odoo Phone 20 adapts to any professional environment, eliminating the need for separate digital cameras or handheld scanners.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_15"><span class="h5-fs">200MP Main Sensor</span><br></h3><p class="lead">
                                Delivers crystal-clear document scanning, receipt OCR parsing, and e-commerce product photography. </p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_12">Ultra-Wide &amp; Macro</h3><p class="lead">Perfect for capturing expansive warehouse layouts or scanning tiny microchip serial numbers.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_13"><span class="h5-fs">LiDAR Depth Scanner</span><br></h3><p class="lead">Instantly measure room dimensions or calculate the volumetric weight of shipping boxes right from your camera app.</p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_16" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Technical Specifications</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><table class="table table-bordered o_table" style="width: 510px;"><colgroup><col style="width: 252.727px;"><col style="width: 256.364px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Feature</strong></p></td><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Specification</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Processor</p></td><td><p class="lead">Odoo Silicon M20 (8-Core Enterprise Architecture)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Display</p></td><td><p class="lead">6.7" Pro-OLED, 120Hz Refresh Rate, 2500 nits peak brightness</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">RAM</p></td><td><p class="lead">64GB LPDDR5X (Built for heavy multitasking)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Chassis Material</p></td><td><p class="lead">Aerospace-grade aluminum, matte finish in Plum, Black or Green</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Durability</p></td><td><p class="lead">IP68 Water and Dust Resistant, Gorilla Glass Victus 2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Connectivity</p></td><td><p class="lead">8G Ultra-Wideband, Wi-Fi 7, Dual-SIM (Pico-SIM + eSIM)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
