    <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p>Deploying the Odoo Phone 20 to your workforce means eliminating third-party hardware bridging. Every device is managed directly from your Odoo <b>Fleet</b> and <b>Employees</b> apps. Instantly provision user access, track physical assets, and lock lost devices remotely—all from your existing dashboard.</p><p><b>Empower your team. Upgrade your workflow today.</b></p>]]></field>
