                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead"><b>Bring your team together or reward your top performers with a console engineered for the modern tech enthusiast.</b></p><p class="lead">Available in deep matte black or crisp matte white, the GameX Extreme combines professional brand aesthetic with pure entertainment. Built around a stunning black screen framed by contrasting controllers, it’s designed to fit right into modern workspaces, lounge areas, or the hands of your valued clients.  </p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
