                    <div class="s_table_of_content_navbar list-group o_no_link_popover" style="top: 76px; max-height: calc(-96px + 100vh);"><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_1" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Sound &amp; Sustainability, Beautifully Combined</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_2" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Key Innovations</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_7" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Acoustic Comfort Architecture</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_6" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Precision Sound Engine</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_8" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Tactile Control System</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_9" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Eco-Engineered Reliability</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_10" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">The Master Acoustic System</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_15" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1 active">40mm Dynamic Drivers</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_12" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">Active Noise Isolation</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_13" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_1">All-Day Battery Optimization</a><a href="#table_of_content_heading_1_16" class="table_of_content_link list-group-item list-group-item-action py-2 border-0 rounded-0 table_of_content_link_depth_0">Technical Specifications</a></div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-9 s_table_of_content_main oe_structure oe_empty o_colored_level" data-name="Content">
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_1" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Sound &amp; Sustainability, Beautifully Combined</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p class="lead">Crafted in our signature Matte Beige, the Airphones aren't just headphones; they're your personal audio sanctuary. Whether you are taking calls on the go, focusing in a busy workspace, or enjoying high-fidelity music, the Airphones deliver immersive sound performance powered by Reloop's eco-responsible engineering.</p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_2" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Key Innovations</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_7"><span class="h5-fs">Acoustic Comfort Architecture</span><br></h3><p class="lead">Ultra-soft leatherette earpads with memory foam contour your ears for total ergonomic support and natural noise isolation.</p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_6">Precision Sound Engine</h3><p class="lead">Custom-tuned high-definition transducers deliver deep bass, balanced mids, and crystal-clear highs across all genres.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_8"><span class="h5-fs">Tactile Control System</span><br></h3><p class="lead">Intuitive physical buttons integrated into the earcup offer seamless management of playback, volume, and calls.</p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_9">Eco-Engineered Reliability</h3><p class="lead">Rigorously tested and reconditioned to Grade-A standards, reducing electronic waste without compromising audio quality.</p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_10" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">The Master Acoustic System</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><p data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_11" class="lead">Equipped with advanced noise-suppression microphones and fine-tuned dynamic drivers, the Airphones adapt to any listening environment.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_15"><span class="h5-fs">40mm Dynamic Drivers</span><br></h3><p class="lead">Deliver ultra-low distortion, rich soundscapes, and studio-grade voice clarity for call precision.</p><h3 class="h5-fs" data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_12">Active Noise Isolation</h3><p class="lead">Passive acoustic seals combine with ambient filtering to keep distraction out and sound in.</p><h3 data-anchor="true" id="table_of_content_heading_1_13"><span class="h5-fs">All-Day Battery Optimization</span><br></h3><p class="lead">Low-power Bluetooth architecture keeps your audio running through long workdays and travel.</p></div>
                    </section><section class="s_text_block pt0 pb64 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Section">
                        <div class="container s_allow_columns"><h2 id="table_of_content_heading_1_16" class="h3-fs" data-anchor="true">Technical Specifications</h2><div class="s_hr pt8 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto">
                            </div><table class="table table-bordered o_table" style="width: 510px;"><colgroup><col style="width: 252.727px;"><col style="width: 256.364px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Feature</strong></p></td><td><p class="lead"><strong style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;">Specification</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Driver Type</p></td><td><p class="lead">40mm High-Definition Dynamic Transducers</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Frequency Response</p></td><td><p class="lead">20Hz - 20,000Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Connectivity</p></td><td><p class="lead">Bluetooth 5.3 + 3.5mm Auxiliary Port</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Battery Life</p></td><td><p class="lead">Up to 40 Hours Continuous Playback</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Chassis Material</p></td><td><p class="lead">Recycled Polymer with Matte Beige Finish</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="lead">Ear Cushions</p></td><td><p class="lead">High-Density Memory Foam &amp; Synthetic Leather</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>]]></field>
    <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p data-oe-version="2.0">Designed to blend understated elegance with absolute comfort, the <b>Airphones</b> headphones feature a sleek, logo-free aesthetic and refined matte beige finishes. These headphones provide exceptional listening comfort with their ultra-soft leatherette earpads and memory foam that perfectly contour your ears for optimal passive isolation, even during the longest listening sessions. Delivered with high-definition audio, <b>Airphones</b> are equipped with precision transducers to offer deep bass, balanced mids, and crystal-clear highs for flawless sound fidelity.</p>]]></field>
